# ADR-003

## Title

Component-based Hero Architecture

## Status

Accepted

## Context

The hero section contains several distinct UI elements that may evolve independently.

## Decision

Split the hero into smaller components:

- Hero
- HeroButtons
- TechStack

## Consequences

Positive

- Easier maintenance
- Better reusability
- Smaller components
- Simpler testing

Negative

- Slightly more files
